### 🏷️ Step 3: Set Repository Website & Topics (SEO Metadata)

1. On your repository homepage, click the **Gear Icon** next to **About** in the right-hand sidebar.
2. In the **Website** field, enter: `[https://buildingcalc.net](https://buildingcalc.net)`
3. In the **Topics** box, add:
   `civil-engineering` `construction-calculator` `pwa` `javascript` `typescript` `concrete-calculator` `quantity-surveying` `open-source`
4. Click **Save changes**.

